nwau-c-abi provides the C ABI header and native library for MCHS/NWAU interop.

In C or C++ consumers, include the header and link the generated library:

  #include <nwau_abi.h>

  int major = nwau_abi_version_major();

CMake package metadata is not yet installed by this draft port. Until that is
added, vcpkg consumers should treat this as a local overlay-readiness artifact,
not a complete upstream vcpkg port.
